  "translation": "O don in na, n ka sanyo bɛna ta u la, n bɛna u bila, n bɛna n ɲɛ lasiri u la bolo, o bɛna kɛ dun ye, ani jatigidiw caman ani gɛlɛyaw bɛna u ye; u bɛna fɔ o don in na ko: “Yala sabu n ka Ala tɛ n kɔnɔ, jurumuw ninnu de ye n don wa?”",
